{"unit_id":"tag:0GZ0:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为范畴（category），将其视为赋有混沌（chaotic）拓扑（topology）的位点（site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 <MATH_0003> 上的环层（sheaf of rings）。对于 <MATH_0004>，如定义 <REF_0001> 中所述，有\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005> 是 <MATH_0006> 的严格全（strictly full）、饱和（saturated）、三角（triangulated）子范畴（subcategory），由任意直和（direct sums）保持，\n<STRUCT_0003> 任意反变（contravariant）上同调函子（cohomological functor）\n<MATH_0007>，\n将直和（direct sums）变为乘积（products），都是可表示（representable）的，\n<STRUCT_0004> 任意正合（exact）函子（functor）<MATH_0008>，作用于三角范畴（triangulated categories）之间，将直和（direct sums）变为直和（direct sums），都有正合（exact）右伴随（right adjoint），且\n<STRUCT_0005> 包含函子（inclusion functor）<MATH_0009> 有正合（exact）右伴随（right adjoint）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"chaotic","target_term":"混沌"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"sheaf of rings","target_term":"环层"},{"source_term":"strictly full","target_term":"严格全"},{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和"},{"source_term":"triangulated","target_term":"三角"},{"source_term":"subcategory","target_term":"子范畴"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"contravariant","target_term":"反变"},{"source_term":"cohomological functor","target_term":"上同调函子"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"products","target_term":"乘积"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表示"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"triangulated categories","target_term":"三角范畴"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"right adjoint","target_term":"右伴随"},{"source_term":"inclusion functor","target_term":"包含函子"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"right adjoint","target_term":"右伴随"}]